  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "启动三班制  (Starting Three Shifts)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At Xingtian's all-hands meeting, Qin Xiao announces the massive joint Star Night live gala with Chun Yuqiao as chief producer, and Yuqiao steps up when other departments balk at lending staff. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真无法想象一个人经历了多少，才能成为公司的核心人物。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "各位，今天现在正式开会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "红毯仪式和媒体组织这次由台里负责。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "制作一部主要负责主会场部分，由淳于总来担任总监制。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "二部、三部、四部的制片力量全部要调用进来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "加上台里的团队，我们总共有一百三十个人的后台队伍保障盛典直播。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "启动三班制，今天下午一点开始。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "项目大，最忌讳的是管理分散，这次以淳于总为核心监制。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "星天职位系统很健全，请问三部的制片都是什么级别？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我有一个办法解决这个问题。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真无法想象一个人经历了多少，才能成为公司的核心人物。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is hard to imagine how much one person endures to become the company's central leader.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "各位，今天现在正式开会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone, let us officially start today's meeting now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "红毯仪式和媒体组织这次由台里负责。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The red-carpet ceremony and press arrangements will be handled by the network.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "制作一部主要负责主会场部分，由淳于总来担任总监制。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Unit One will lead the main venue, with Chun Yuqiao serving as chief producer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "二部、三部、四部的制片力量全部要调用进来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Production staff from Units Two, Three, and Four will all be called in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "加上台里的团队，我们总共有一百三十个人的后台队伍保障盛典直播。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Counting the network team, we have a hundred-thirty-person backstage crew securing the gala broadcast.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "启动三班制，今天下午一点开始。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Start a three-shift schedule, beginning at one o'clock this afternoon.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "项目大，最忌讳的是管理分散，这次以淳于总为核心监制。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On a huge project, scattered management is the biggest taboo, so Yuqiao is our core producer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "星天职位系统很健全，请问三部的制片都是什么级别？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian's rank system is sound; may I ask what level Unit Three's producers hold?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我有一个办法解决这个问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have a way to solve this problem.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真无法想象一个人经历了多少，才能成为公司的核心人物。",
      "gap": 0.5
