    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "启动三班制，今天下午一点开始。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "项目大，最忌讳的是管理分散，这次以淳于总为核心监制。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "星天职位系统很健全，请问三部的制片都是什么级别？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我有一个办法解决这个问题。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chun Yuqiao takes command of the Star Night gala and promises a solution to unite the production floor, setting the stage for Episode 4. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
